  "remarks": "Association “League for Assistance to Defence Enterprises” is a non-profit organisation based in Moscow. It consists of representatives from the Government of the Russian Federation, federal legislative and executive bodies, heads and representatives of public and private military industry corporations, major holdings, associations and enterprises. The organisation aims to promote the development,modernisation and further growth of the Russian military industry. It advocates for the interests of the domestic defence industry with Russian government bodies and civil society institutions, in particular to promote innovation, strengthen training and foster recruitment opportunities for defence companies. It also aims to assist Russian defence companies in the implementation of the state armament program and state military procurement.",
